msgid ""
"Hides glossary components when shared to other projects, see "
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS`."
msgstr ""
"Döljer ordlistekomponenter när de delas med andra projekt, se "
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS`."

msgid "Lists all possible change event types."
msgstr "Listar alla möjliga typer av ändringshändelser."

msgid "Set the desired number of votes for automatic acceptance."
msgstr "Ange det önskade antalet röster för automatiskt godkännande."

msgid ""
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS` to hide glossaries shared into "
"other projects."
msgstr ""
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS` för att dölja ordlistor som delas"
" med andra projekt."

msgid ""
"Added new management command :wladmin:`list_change_events`, which lists all "
"possible change events, :ref:`addon-choice-events`."
msgstr ""
"Lade till det nya hanteringskommandot :wladmin:`list_change_events`, som "
"listar alla möjliga ändringshändelser, :ref:`addon-choice-events`."

msgid ""
"Delete announcements permission can be assigned to teams, see "
":ref:`privileges`."
msgstr ""
"Behörigheten att ta bort meddelanden kan tilldelas grupper, se "
":ref:`privileges`."

msgid ":doc:`/user/search` better reports errors in the query strings."
msgstr ":doc:`/user/search` rapporterar bättre fel i frågesträngarna."

msgid "Regular repository maintenance is now performed in the background."
msgstr "Regelbundet arkivunderhåll utförs nu i bakgrunden."

msgid "Repository cleanup now recovers failed merges or rebases."
msgstr ""
"Arkivrensning återställer nu misslyckade sammanfogningar eller ombaseringar."

msgid "Automatic :ref:`component-repoweb` URL for common code hosting sites."
msgstr "Automatisk :ref:`component-repoweb`-URL för vanliga kodvärdar."
